[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0351","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0351.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0346","title":"Apple AppleShare IP 6.x 信息披露漏洞","description":"AppleShare IP 6.x 网络共享服务器在 HTTP Range 请求头的验证处理中存在安全漏洞。当攻击者向服务器发送格式错误的范围请求头时，服务器未能正确解析或验证请求边界，导致对共享文件夹中存储的敏感文件进行目录遍历和信息泄露。该漏洞允许任何远程未认证攻击者通过特制的无效范围请求获取目录列表、文件内容等系统敏感信息，可能暴露企业的商业机密和用户数据。 CVSS 评估显示此漏洞评分为 5.0，等级为中危，影响主要集中在保密性层面，对完整性和可用性无直接影响，攻击者无需特殊条件即可远程触发。 AppleShare IP 6.x 用户应立即更新到最新版本，并采取服务器访问控制措施以限制敏感资源泄露的风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0346"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:31Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 AppleShare IP 到 6.3.1 或更高版本（Apple 已在 2001 年发布的 AppleShare IP 6.3.1 修复了该漏洞）。如暂时无法升级，可在 Web 服务器前部署反向代理或 WAF 规则拦截包含无效 Range 头的 HTTP 请求（如 Range: bytes=-1,-2 等异常范围），或在防火墙层面限制 Web 服务仅对可信 IP 开放 80/443 端口作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://asu.info.apple.com/swupdates.nsf/artnum/n11670","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1162","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=20000502133240.21807.qmail%40securityfocus.com","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0346.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0346","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0346.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0346.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pp76-3w2g-vm3m/GHSA-pp76-3w2g-vm3m.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0346.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--95543076-20db-4837-82c7-9166f71f32e7.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/48d9bee10ba6f9c95b14d9de429f21fee40e28eb/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0351.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0351.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0351.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0299","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0299.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0347","title":"Microsoft Windows 95/98 NetBIOS 空源名称拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 95/98 的 NetBIOS 协议实现存在空源名称处理缺陷，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标系统发送特制的 NetBIOS 会话请求数据包，其中源名称字段设置为 NULL，导致目标系统网络服务崩溃或停止响应，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows 95 和 Windows 98 系统，攻击条件低，仅需通过网络发送单个恶意数据包即可触发，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。ExploitDB 已公开该漏洞的利用代码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0347"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:31Z","remediation":"由于 Windows 95/98 已停止支持且无官方补丁，建议在防火墙或边界路由器上阻止 UDP 137-138 端口和 TCP 139 端口的入站流量，以阻断远程 NetBIOS 攻击。同时可在网络适配器属性中禁用 NetBIOS over TCP/IP，或升级至受支持的 Windows 版本（如 Windows 10/11）并启用 Windows Defender 防火墙。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=95737580922397&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1163","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19889","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0347.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0347","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0347.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0347.json","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/1239.txt","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/netbios.rules","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/R/rfparalyze.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0347.json","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/snort/drop-rules/sid-msg.map"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0299.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0296","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0296.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0343","title":"Brecht Claerhout Sniffit 日志记录缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Sniffit 0.3.x 的 -L 日志记录选项存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标 Sniffit 服务发送特制的超长 MAIL FROM 邮件头触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，进而实现远程代码执行。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用此漏洞完全控制受影响系统。该漏洞影响 Sniffit 0.3.6 HIP 及 0.3.7 Beta 版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。目前已有公开的 ExploitDB 利用代码（ID: 19888）。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0343"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:31Z","remediation":"立即停止使用 Sniffit 0.3.x 系列版本，该软件已长期无人维护且无官方补丁。建议迁移至 Snort、tcpdump 或 Wireshark 等活跃维护的网络监控工具。如暂时无法替换，务必禁用 -L 日志记录选项（不使用 -L normmail 参数启动），并在防火墙层面限制 Sniffit 所在主机的 SMTP 端口（25）入站流量，降低远程触发风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1158","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=200005021736.TAA01991%40ALuSSi","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19888","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0343.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0343","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0343.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0343.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-q5jj-xjv6-mqg6/GHSA-q5jj-xjv6-mqg6.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0343.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0296.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0257","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0257.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0293","title":"SuSE Linux aaa_base 任意文件删除漏洞","description":"SuSE Linux 6.x 系统的 aaa_base（6.3 版本）及更早版本的 cron.daily 脚本在清理 /tmp 目录过期文件时存在空格文件名处理缺陷。由于脚本未对包含空格的文件名进行正确的引号包裹或转义处理，本地攻击者可在 /tmp 下创建文件名包含空格的特制文件，当 aaa_base 自动删除过期文件时，会将空格分割后的文件名片段解析为多个独立参数，导致系统意外删除其他非目标文件。该漏洞影响 SuSE Linux 6.x 系列，CVSS 2.1 低危，需本地访问权限方可利用。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0293"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:24Z","remediation":"升级 SuSE Linux 至 6.4 及以上版本，或安装 SuSE 官方提供的 aaa_base 安全补丁。如无法升级，可修改 aaa_base 脚本中清理 /tmp 目录的逻辑，对文件名变量添加双引号包裹（如 `\"$file\"`）以防止 shell 通配符/空格解析错误，同时限制清理范围仅针对应用自身创建的文件而非全目录扫描。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1130","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19867","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5c4b2ba2a59a96457ab4b8ea4ee82efc5782bb1d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0293.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0293","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0293.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/475f53ac063af305fc146a443cce993188109d56/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0293.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xmpr-c4ff-x7wm/GHSA-xmpr-c4ff-x7wm.json","https://github.com/CWE-CAPEC/REST-API-wg/blob/5a8974308ef38e8ee4979e4a29b3b3a22c647822/json_repo/W/48.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1130/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0293.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0257.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0123","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0123.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0138","title":"系统被植入 DDoS 攻击工具（Trinoo/TFN/TFN2K/stacheldraht/mstream/shaft）拒绝服务漏洞","description":"CVE-2000-0138 描述了系统中被植入分布式拒绝服务（DDoS）攻击工具的情况，包括控制端（master）、代理端（agent）或僵尸程序（zombie）。具体涉及 Trinoo、Tribe Flood Network（TFN）、TFN2K、stacheldraht、mstream、shaft 等六种 DDoS 工具。攻击者通过这些工具在已被入侵的主机上建立僵尸网络，远程下发攻击指令，向特定目标发送大量恶意流量，导致目标网络带宽耗尽或系统资源枯竭，无法提供正常服务。攻击条件为攻击者已获得系统访问权限并安装了相应的 DDoS 恶意程序，危害程度中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0138"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:04Z","remediation":"使用最新病毒库的杀毒软件全盘扫描并清除 Trinoo、TFN、TFN2K、stacheldraht、mstream、shaft 等 DDoS 木马；在防火墙上封锁已知端口（Trinoo 的 1524/tcp、27444/udp、31335/udp，Stacheldraht 的 16660/tcp、65000/tcp，mstream 的 12754/tcp、15104/tcp）；检查系统自启动项、计划任务和异常网络连接，移除可疑进程和文件，并限制非必要对外通信。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95715370208598&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95722093124322&w=2","http://xforce.iss.net/alerts/advise48.php3","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8ac21ad6117514c2d2073c3d7d77e898bf2697d2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0138.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0138","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0138.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5c6904371163d9b81521151d4181001adee1b956/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0138.json","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/247.txt","https://github.com/universal-ctags/ctags/blob/5437fa6249e95ec55a5f4944dac28f4f6e46c195/Units/review-needed.r/too-large-for-reviewing-3526726.tex.t/input.tex","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/15e03a1f168cc2879e6a9485d5d70b74c6e6cf7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6w6r-f2f7-xh5j/GHSA-6w6r-f2f7-xh5j.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/doc/faq.tex","https://github.com/bailehang/snort_2.2.0/blob/34f8a3a85f15645aea53d6e0d46863c7c57e43ef/doc/signatures/234.txt","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/T/trinity.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0123.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0490","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0490.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0448","title":"网络联合 WebShield SMTP 管理工具 SMTP管理端口访问控制绕过漏洞","description":"WebShield SMTP管理系统4.5.44版本存在安全漏洞，该系统在处理未解析主机名的IP地址时，未能正确限制管理端口的访问权限，导致攻击者可通过GET_CONFIG命令远程访问系统配置。该漏洞影响范围广泛，只要存在网络通信，该管理工具均可受到影响，攻击者无需身份验证即可执行远程代码访问操作，最终可能导致敏感信息泄露，威胁到用户的网络安全。利用此漏洞攻击者可以通过发送特制网络请求来绕过访问控制机制，获取系统配置信息，并可能进一步利用获取的信息进行攻击。Microsoft已发布安全更新修复了此漏洞，建议用户及时进行系统更新以确保安全。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0448"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:45Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至 WebShield SMTP 4.5.44 之后的修复版本（建议升级至 McAfee Security for Email Servers 最新版）。若无法升级，请在防火墙配置仅允许受信任管理IP访问 SMTP 管理端口（默认 8081/TCP），并在 DNS 服务器配置管理服务器 IP 的 PTR 反向解析记录，确保 IP 能正确解析为主机名以触发访问控制。若产品已停止维护，建议迁移至 Microsoft Exchange Online Protection 或 Proofpoint Email Protection 等现代邮件安全网关。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/326","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1253","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=6C740781F92BD411831F0090273A8AB806FD4A%40exchange.servers.delphis.net","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6871b34457c95f7cba228f12a5ad62036a72e749/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0448.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0448","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0448.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3e56369e6f703dfde20132e3205d609e016e88bd/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0448.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g58c-99hx-fmc6/GHSA-g58c-99hx-fmc6.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0448.md","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/nai_webshield_info.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0448.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0490.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0488","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0488.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0447","title":"Trend Micro WebShield SMTP 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Network Associates WebShield SMTP 4.5.44 版本的远程管理服务存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向管理服务发送超长的配置参数触发栈溢出，导致在目标系统上以服务进程权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 WebShield SMTP 4.5.44 版本，攻击向量为网络远程、攻击复杂度低、无需身份认证，成功利用可导致系统机密性、完整性和可用性全部被破坏，CVSS 评分 7.5（高危）。攻击者只需向目标服务的管理端口发送超长配置参数即可触发溢出并执行任意代码，Network Associates 已发布补丁修复该漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0447"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:45Z","remediation":"立即升级至 Network Associates WebShield SMTP 4.5.44 之后的修补版本（建议升级至 McAfee WebShield SMTP 4.5.50 或更高版本），官方补丁可通过 Network Associates 安全公告 NAI-2000-001 获取。若无法立即升级，请在防火墙层面封锁 WebShield 远程管理服务端口（默认 TCP 8080/8443），仅允许受信任管理网段访问，并禁用远程配置参数接口作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/327","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1254","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=6C740781F92BD411831F0090273A8AB806FD4A%40exchange.servers.delphis.net","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6871b34457c95f7cba228f12a5ad62036a72e749/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0447.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0447","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0447.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3e56369e6f703dfde20132e3205d609e016e88bd/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0447.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rgrc-m757-f2p2/GHSA-rgrc-m757-f2p2.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0447.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001332.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--661b9657-78f7-4272-8f0e-4661f6be094c.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0488.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0426","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0426.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0401","title":"PDGSoft Shopping Cart redirect.exe/changepw.exe 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"PDGSoft 购物车系统中的 redirect.exe 和 changepw.exe 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向这两个组件发送超长查询字符串（query string）触发缓冲区溢出，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 PDGSoft 购物车早期版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程利用，危害严重。目前厂商已停止维护，建议用户迁移至其他替代方案。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0401"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:38Z","remediation":"立即从 PDGSoft 官方渠道（原 security2.html 页面）安装针对 redirect.exe 和 changepw.exe 的缓冲区溢出补丁。由于该产品已停止维护多年，强烈建议迁移至仍在安全更新的替代购物车系统。如无法立即替换，可在 Web 服务器（IIS/Apache）层面通过 URL 重写或访问控制规则，限制对 redirect.exe 和 changepw.exe 的访问，仅允许受信 IP 调用，并在输入参数长度上做严格限制（如截断超过 256 字节的 query string）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95928319715983&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=95928667119963&w=2","http://www.pdgsoft.com/Security/security2.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1256","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0401.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0401","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0401.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0401.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/changepw.nasl","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/e7a1e0098ca50c8dc77455488033ca407ec81282/sara/PLIST","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1256/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0401.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001330.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0426.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0426.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0371","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0371.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0449","title":"Omnis Omnis Studio 2.4 数据库字段弱加密漏洞","description":"Omnis Studio 2.4 数据库工具在数据库字段加密时使用了弱加密算法，仅实现了简单的转码而非真正的加密保护，攻击者可以轻易绕过加密机制获取原始数据。该漏洞影响所有使用 Omnis Studio 2.4 的用户，可能泄露数据库中的敏感信息，包括用户凭据、商业机密、个人隐私等。攻击者无需任何权限即可远程利用此漏洞，完全破坏了数据库加密的安全性，攻击难度低但破坏力极强，导致系统完全保密、完整性和可用性遭到严重破坏。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0449"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:45Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至 Omnis Studio 3.0 或更高版本（官方已修复弱加密问题）。如无法立即升级，建议在应用层对敏感数据库字段实施 AES-256 加密存储，或启用数据库透明加密（TDE）保护敏感字段，同时在应用层实施字段级加密作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0311.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1255","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19967","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d83a2c403dbad5ade9ae20db8a18ec06947c25f6/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0449.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0449","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0449.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3e56369e6f703dfde20132e3205d609e016e88bd/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0449.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jr8c-jq2f-gfh3/GHSA-jr8c-jq2f-gfh3.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0449.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/3940e07c0108f0ccff15cf6d7011c1c64b16d80e/2000.tsv","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0449.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0371.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0359","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0359.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0440","title":"NetBSD IP Timestamp 选项拒绝服务漏洞","description":"NetBSD 1.4.2 及更早版本存在 IP 时间戳选项拒绝服务漏洞。该漏洞原理为远程攻击者向目标系统发送包含未对齐 IP 时间戳选项的恶意数据包时，由于内核在处理带有非标准对齐方式的 IP 时间戳选项时缺乏充分验证，导致内核panic或服务崩溃，从而引发拒绝服务。影响范围包括 FreeBSD 3.4/4.0/5.0 以及 NetBSD 1.4.2 及更早版本系统。攻击条件为：攻击者具备网络可达性，且无需认证凭据即可完成攻击。攻击者仅需构造并发送一个包含未对齐 IP 时间戳选项的数据包即可触发漏洞，利用方式简单，可直接导致目标主机不可用或服务中断，对系统可用性造成严重影响。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0440"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:44Z","remediation":"NetBSD 用户应立即升级至 NetBSD 1.4.2 或更高版本，FreeBSD 用户应升级至 FreeBSD 4.1-STABLE、5.0-CURRENT 修复版本或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可在边界防火墙或路由器上配置 ACL，过滤携带 IP Timestamp 选项（option type 0x44）的数据包，以临时缓解拒绝服务风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0088.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1173","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19896","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/84a32f54509ea69818fd2f28519fed9f2968cec3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0440.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0440","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0440.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4efe50030f98e26c62a2548f14fe89d9f72e2021/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0440.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e34faa994a969a96da73434c6e96d687fa245753/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-3fw7-2f85-c369/GHSA-3fw7-2f85-c369.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--55ba3501-8aef-42cc-a283-cb7ca217a369.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0440.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--55ba3501-8aef-42cc-a283-cb7ca217a369.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0359.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0347","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0347.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0344","title":"Linux Kernel knfsd NFS 服务拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux Kernel 2.2.x 版本中的 knfsd NFS 服务器存在输入验证缺陷，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送包含负值大小参数的恶意 NFS 请求触发该漏洞，导致 knfsd 服务崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux Kernel 2.1/2.2.0/2.3.0 等版本，攻击无需身份认证且无需用户交互，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0344"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:31Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 2.2.19 或更高版本（该漏洞在 2.2.x 后续版本中已修复），或在 NFS 服务器上限制 knfsd 的访问来源 IP，仅允许可信网段连接，同时禁用 NFSv2 协议以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1160","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.LNX.4.21.0005012042550.6419-100000%40ferret.lmh.ox.ac.uk","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0344.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0344","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0344.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0344.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2000-0344.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-p8m9-pjr4-qwm7/GHSA-p8m9-pjr4-qwm7.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/knfs_dos.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0344.json","https://github.com/shamedgh/confine/blob/a75dad3ad336e6258a42cd1ce4af061eea68ed76/cve.files/cveToFile.json.type.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0347.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0291","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0291.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0341","title":"Atrium Software Cassandra NNTP Server 1.10 登录拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Atrium Software Cassandra NNTP Server 1.10 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向登录认证接口提交超长用户名，触发服务端缓冲区溢出，导致 NNTP 服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击条件简单，仅需发送特制超长字符串即可触发。公开的 ExploitDB 编号 19884 提供了完整的利用代码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0341"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:30Z","remediation":"该漏洞存在于 Atrium Software Cassandra NNTP Server 1.10 中，该产品已停止维护且厂商不再提供补丁。建议立即迁移至其他受支持的 NNTP 服务器软件（如 INN、Leafnode 等）。在完成迁移前，可在防火墙层面限制对 TCP 119 端口的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接，以降低被远程利用的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=95736106504870&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1156","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19884","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0341.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0341","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0341.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0341.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-82rf-86fv-87vg/GHSA-82rf-86fv-87vg.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0341.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--4d289393-9ec2-4a22-8ec0-b70ee028cd88.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0291.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0290","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0290.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0340","title":"SuSE Linux Gnomelib 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"S.u.S.E. Linux 6.3/6.4 版本中的 Gnomelib 库存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，源于对 DISPLAY 环境变量缺乏边界长度检查。本地攻击者可通过设置超长的 DISPLAY 环境变量值触发栈缓冲区溢出，进而在目标系统上以提升后的权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 SuSE Linux 6.3 和 6.4 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2（本地攻击、低复杂度、无需认证、完全机密性/完整性/可用性影响），攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限方可利用。攻击者可构造恶意环境变量触发缓冲区溢出，劫持程序控制流执行任意 Shellcode 实现本地提权。ExploitDB 已收录该漏洞的本地缓冲区溢出利用代码（EDB-ID: 19883）。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0340"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:30Z","remediation":"升级至 S.u.S.E. Linux 6.4 或更高版本，该版本中的 gnomelib 已修复 DISPLAY 环境变量缓冲区溢出问题。如无法升级，可移除 /opt/gnome/sbin/gnome-pty-helper 的 setgid 权限（chmod g-s /opt/gnome/sbin/gnome-pty-helper），并限制本地用户对 DISPLAY 变量的异常长度输入作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1155","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=00042902575201.09597%40wintermute-pub","http://www.suse.com/us/support/download/updates/axp_63.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19883","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0340.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0340","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0340.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0340.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r7r2-2mff-xm27/GHSA-r7r2-2mff-xm27.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0340.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001326.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--97ad9843-21b0-4426-9018-a22266ea74ed.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0290.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0293","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0293.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0342","title":"Qualcomm Eudora 4.x 可执行附件警告绕过漏洞","description":"Qualcomm Eudora 4.x 邮件客户端存在安全警告绕过漏洞（CWE-59，链接跟随问题）。远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送包含 .lnk 快捷方式文件的恶意邮件，该快捷方式指向 .exe、.com 或 .bat 等可执行附件，从而绕过 Eudora 内置的可执行附件安全警告机制。当用户点击看似无害的 .lnk 文件时，系统将自动执行其指向的可执行程序，导致任意代码执行。攻击者无需任何身份认证，仅需诱使用户打开邮件即可触发。该漏洞影响 Eudora 4.x 全版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0342"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-28T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:31Z","remediation":"升级到 Eudora 5.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复 .lnk 文件绕过附件警告的问题。如无法升级，请在 Eudora 设置中禁用\"自动打开附件\"选项，并教育用户不要打开来自不可信来源的 .lnk 后缀文件。同时可在邮件网关层面过滤带有 .lnk 附件的邮件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://news.cnet.com/news/0-1005-200-1773077.html?tag=st.ne.fd.lthd.1005-200-1773077","http://www.peacefire.org/security/stealthattach/explanation.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1157","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/23399","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-0342.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0342.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0342","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0342.json","https:/